-1 alignment.  Almost completely meaningless, especially if it's not
_very_ early in the game.   Killing a handful of non-peaceful monsters
will increase your alignment.  Usually unless you're a pacifist then
your alignment hovers near the maximum (barring tragedies like killing
your pet, etc) and killing a peaceful creature here or there or eating
meat as a monk or whatever doesn't have a noticeable effect.

Now, butchering a whole slew of peacefuls or eating 10-20 meat items
without killing a few hostiles in between could be bad.  But just
eating corpses for intrinsics every now and then is generally fine.



